						  set elObjSub = elObj.%ConstructClone()
						  set elObjSub.x12Data = ""
						  set elObjSub.Subscriber = "" , elObjSub.Dependent = ""
						  Do elObjSub.x12DataStream.Clear()
						  set elObjSub.SeqNum = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2)
						  $$$TRACE("Saved 277 at HL: " _ elObj.%Id())
			  		}
				  	elseif ( ($IsObject(elObjSub)) && ( (elObjSub.Subscriber '= "") || (elObjSub.Dependent '= "")) )
				  	{
					  	Do $INCREMENT(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType))
					  	set elObjSub.UniqId = ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType)
					  	set elObjSub.X12DataParentId = parentId
					  	set elObjSub.x12Data = segX12Data
					  	set elObjSub.ProcessDtTm = $ZDATETIME($HOROLOG,3, 1)
				  		Do elObjSub.%Save()
				  		Do $INCREMENT(objCnt)
				  		$$$TRACE("Saved 277 Sub at HL: " _ elObjSub.%Id() _ ", Sub: " _ elObjSub.Subscriber _", Dep: " _ elObjSub.Dependent)				  					  		
				  	}

				  	set hlVal = retVal // HL level code

				  	if (hlVal = "Subscriber")
				  	{
					  	set elObjSub = elObj.%ConstructClone()
					  	Do elObjSub.x12DataStream.Clear()
					  	set segX12Data = segVal _ STRecord.SegmentTerminator // Start new X12 segment
					  	set elObjSub.SeqNum = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2)
					  	Do $INCREMENT(subCnt)
				  	}
				  	else
				  	{
					  	set segX12Data = segX12Data _ segVal _ STRecord.SegmentTerminator // Append Dependent HL data
				  	}
			  	} //HL

			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"ST") = 3)
			  	{
				  	set elObj.TransactionSetControlNumber = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 3)
				  	$$$TRACE("Ctrl number for 277 at ST: " _ elObj.TransactionSetControlNumber)
			  	}
			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"SE") = 3) 
			  	{

					Do $INCREMENT(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType))
					set elObjSub.UniqId = ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType)
					set elObjSub.X12DataParentId = parentId
					set elObjSub.x12Data = segX12Data
					set elObjSub.ProcessDtTm = $ZDATETIME($HOROLOG,3, 1)  	
				  	Do elObjSub.%Save()
				  	Do $INCREMENT(objCnt)
				  	$$$TRACE("Saved 277 at SE: " _ elObjSub.%Id())

			  	}

			  	else
			  	{
				  	// WRITE !, "      ***** Not stored: " _ segVal
			  	}
			  	if ($FIND(segVal,"HL") '= 3)
			  	{
			  		set segX12Data = segX12Data _ segVal _ STRecord.SegmentTerminator // Append data
			  	}
			  }
		  }
		  set elObj.SeqNum = objCnt - 1
		  Do elObj.%Save()
		  $$$TRACE("Last Save 277: " _ elObj.%Id())
    }
	 $$$TRACE(  " --- Processing complete: IHC.X12.Data277, ClaimStatusResponse, # rows:" _ objCnt)
	 return elObj.%Id()

	set elObj = ##class(IHC.X12.Data277CA).%New()
	  set elObjProv = $$$NULLOREF // 20, 2000A		   
	  set elObjServiceProv = $$$NULLOREF // 22, 2000B
	  if ($GET(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType)) = "")
	 {
	 	set ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType) = 1
	 }
	 else
	 {
		 Do $INCREMENT(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType))
		 set elObj.UniqId = ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType)
	 }
	Do ..InitFirstObject(elObj, x12Doc, fileName, stat, receiptDtTm, direction, sessionId ) 

	set parentId = "", objCnt =0
	set GSCounter = x12Doc.ChildCount

	for gsInt=1:1:GSCounter
    { 
        #dim individualGroup As EnsLib.EDI.X12.Document
        set individualGroup = x12Doc.getNthChild(gsInt,2)


		  set parentId = "", objCnt =0


		  FOR stInd=1:1:individualGroup.ChildCount
		  {
			  #dim STRecord As EnsLib.EDI.X12.Document 

			  set STRecord=individualGroup.getNthChild(stInd,2)


			  set STRecord.DocType = "HIPAA_5010:277CA"
			  set stat = STRecord.BuildMap()

			  if ($$$ISERR(stat))
			  {
				  $$$LOGERROR("ST build: " _  transType_ ": " _  stat)
				  set elObj.Status = "Data"
				  Do elObj.%Save()

				  set parentId = elObj.%Id()
				  $$$TRACE( "  IHC.X12.Data277CA ID: " _ elObj.%Id())
				  //return ""

			  }



			  set segX12Data = "", subCnt = 0

	  		  set entityType = ""

			  FOR ind=1:1:STRecord.SegCountGet()
			  {

				set segPath = STRecord.GetSegmentPath(ind, .stat)	  	
			  	set segVal = STRecord.GetValueAt(segPath,, .stat)



			  	if ($FIND(segVal,"BHT") = 4)
			  	{
				  	set elObj.BhtId = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
				  	set seg1Val = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 7)
				  	if (seg1Val '= "")
				  	{
				  		Do ##class(IHC.ITF.ITFCOMMON.Utility).ItfLookup("IHC.ITF.Process.Bpl.Bht6Lookup", seg1Val, .retVal)

				  		set elObj.BhtPurpose = retVal 

				  	}
			  	}
			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"REF") = 4)
			  	{
				  	set seg1Val = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2)
				  	if (seg1Val = "1K") 
				  	{
				  		set elObjServiceProv.ClaimControlNumber = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 3)
				  	}
				  	elseif (seg1Val = "D9") 
				  	{
				  		set elObjServiceProv.ClearinghouseTraceNumber = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 3)
				  	}

			  	}
			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"DTP") = 4)
			  	{
				  	set seg1Val = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2)
				  	Do ##class(IHC.ITF.ITFCOMMON.Utility).ItfLookup("IHC.ITF.Process.Bpl.DTPLookup", seg1Val, .retVal)

				  	if (seg1Val = "472") 
				  	{
				  		set elObjServiceProv.ServiceDate = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
				  	}
				  	elseif (seg1Val = "434") 
				  	{
				  		set elObjServiceProv.ServiceDate = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
				  	}
			  	}


			  	elseif ( ($FIND(segVal,"TRN") = 4) && $IsObject(elObjServiceProv) )
			  	{
				  	set elObjServiceProv.ClaimStatusId = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 3)


			  	}
			  	elseif ( ($FIND(segVal,"STC") = 4) && $IsObject(elObjServiceProv) )
			  	{

				  	set elObjServiceProv.ClaimAmount = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 5)
				  	set elObjServiceProv.ClaimActionCode = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)

			  	}
			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"NM1") = 4)
			  	{

				  	set seg1Val = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2)
				  	Do ##class(IHC.ITF.ITFCOMMON.Utility).ItfLookup("IHC.ITF.Process.Bpl.NM1lookup", seg1Val, .retVal)

				  	if (seg1Val = "40")
				  	{
					  	set elObj.Receiver = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
				  	}
				  	if (seg1Val = "41")
				  	{
					  	set elObj.Submitter = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
				  	}
				  	if (seg1Val = "85")
				  	{
					  	set elObj.BillingProvider = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 5) _ " " _ $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
					  	set elObj.BillingProviderNpi = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 10)
				  	}
				  	if (seg1Val = "PR")
				  	{
					  	set elObj.Payer = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
				  	}
				  	if (seg1Val = "IL")
				  	{
					  	set elObjServiceProv.Subscriber = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 5) _ " " _ $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
					  	set elObjServiceProv.SubscriberId = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 10)
					  	set entityType = "Subscriber"
				  	}

				  	if (seg1Val = "QC")
				  	{
					  	set elObjServiceProv.Patient = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 5) _ " " _ $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
					  	set entityType = "Patient"
				  	}


			  	}
			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"HI") = 3)
			  	{
				  	if ($PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2) [ "ABK")
				  	{
					 	set elObjServiceProv.DiagnosisCode = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2)
				  	}

			  	}


			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"ST") = 3)
			  	{
				  	set elObj.TransactionSetControlNumber = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 3)
			  	}
			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"SE") = 3) 
			  	{

					Do $INCREMENT(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType))
					set elObjServiceProv.UniqId = ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType)
					set elObjServiceProv.X12DataParentId = parentId
					set elObjServiceProv.x12Data = segX12Data
					set elObjServiceProv.ProcessDtTm = $ZDATETIME($HOROLOG,3, 1)  	
				  	set stat = elObjServiceProv.%Save()
				  	Do $INCREMENT(objCnt)


			  	}

			  	elseif ($FIND(segVal,"HL") = 3)
			  	{

				  	set newTrn = 0
	  			  	set seg3Val = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 4)
				  	Do ##class(IHC.ITF.ITFCOMMON.Utility).ItfLookup("IHC.ITF.Process.Bpl.HlCodeLookup", seg3Val, .retVal)
				  	if (seg3Val = "PT")
				  	{


					  	if (elObj.%Id() = "" ) // First 2000C, parent
					  	{
					  		  Do elObj.%Save()
					  		  Do $INCREMENT(objCnt)
							  set parentId = elObj.%Id()



							  set elObjServiceProv = $$$NULLOREF
							  set elObjProv = $$$NULLOREF
							  set elObjProv = elObj.%ConstructClone()
							  Do elObjProv.x12DataStream.Clear()
							  set elObjServiceProv = elObj.%ConstructClone()
							  Do elObjServiceProv.x12DataStream.Clear()
							  set elObjServiceProv.SeqNum = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2)
							  set segX12Data = segVal _ STRecord.SegmentTerminator // Start new X12 segment
				  		}
				  		else
					  	{
						  	Do $INCREMENT(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType))
						  	set elObjServiceProv.UniqId = ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType)
						  	set elObjServiceProv.X12DataParentId = parentId
						  	set elObjServiceProv.x12Data = segX12Data
						  	set elObjServiceProv.ProcessDtTm = $ZDATETIME($HOROLOG,3, 1)
					  		set stat = elObjServiceProv.%Save()
					  		Do $INCREMENT(objCnt)

					  		set elObjServiceProv = elObjProv.%ConstructClone()
					  		set elObjServiceProv.SeqNum = $PIECE(segVal, x12Doc.ElementSeparator , 2)
					  		set segX12Data = segVal _ STRecord.SegmentTerminator // Start new X12 segment
					  	}



				  	}


			  	}

			  	else
			  	{
				  	// WRITE !, "      ***** Not stored: " _ segVal
			  	}
			  	if ($FIND(segVal,"HL") '= 3)
			  	{
			  		set segX12Data = segX12Data _ segVal _ STRecord.SegmentTerminator // Append data
			  	}
			  }
		  }
		  set elObj.SeqNum = objCnt - 1
		  Do elObj.%Save()
    }
	$$$TRACE(  " --- Processing complete: IHC.X12.Data277CA, ClaimAcknowledgment, # rows:" _ objCnt)
	return elObj.%Id()

  set GSnum = 1, parentId = "", objCnt =0, ackObj = $$$NULLOREF, ak2Obj = $$$NULLOREF


  if ($GET(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType)) = "")
	 {

	 	set ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType) = 1
	 }
	 else
	 {
		 Do $INCREMENT(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType))
	 }

  if ( ($ISOBJECT(x12Doc)) && (x12Doc.%Extends("EnsLib.EDI.X12.Document")) )
  {
		 if (x12Doc.DocType = "")
		 {

	    		set x12Doc.DocType =  "HIPAA_5010:Interchange" 
	    		Set tSC =x12Doc.BuildMap() 

		 }


	    set interchangeReceiverID = $ZSTRIP(x12Doc.GetValueAt("ISA:InterchangeReceiverID"), "<>W")
	    set interchangeSenderID = $ZSTRIP(x12Doc.GetValueAt("ISA:InterchangeSenderID"), "<>W")
	    set ISA13 = $ZSTRIP(x12Doc.GetValueAt("ISA:InterchangeControlNumber"),"<","0")

	   // WRITE !, interchangeSenderID _" -> " _ interchangeReceiverID _", Ctrl #" _ISA13 

	   set x12Doc.DocType = "HIPAA_5010:Interchange:Group" 
       set GSCounter = x12Doc.ChildCount
       set mmId = $EXTRACT($ZDATE($HOROLOG, 8), 1, 6)


       /* Iterates through available number of group's and collects group level information and sets to gsDoc object */
          set segX12Data = ""
          while ( GSnum <= GSCounter)
          { 
            set individualGroup = x12Doc.getNthChild(GSnum,2)
            set individualGroup.DocType = "HIPAA_5010:Group"

	        set GS02 = individualGroup.GetValueAt("GS:ApplicationSendersCode")        
	        set GS03 = individualGroup.GetValueAt("GS:ApplicationReceiversCode")

	        set GS06 = individualGroup.GetValueAt("GS:GroupControlNumber")
	        set GSver = individualGroup.GetValueAt("GS:VersionReleaseIndustryIdenti")

	        // WRITE !, "GS: " _ GS02 _" / " _ GS06
	        set STCounter = individualGroup.ChildCount 

	        #dim individualST As EnsLib.EDI.X12.Document
	        set STnum = 1
	        while ( STnum <= STCounter)
	        { 
	          set individualST = individualGroup.getNthChild(STnum)
	          set individualST.DocType="HIPAA_5010:999" 
	          set loopNum = 1
	          // WRITE !, "ST= " _ individualST.GetValueAt("ST:1") _ " / " _ individualST.GetValueAt("ST:2")
	          set GroupRespControlNumber = individualST.GetValueAt("AK1:2")
	          set GroupRespAckCode = individualST.GetValueAt("AK9:1")

	          set cur2000status = 1 

	          while (cur2000status = 1)
	          {
	           set cur2000path="loop2000("_loopNum_").AK2"
			   set cur2000ind=individualST.GetSegmentIndex(cur2000path,.cur2000status)
			   if (cur2000status = 1)
			   {
			   	  set cur2000pathIK="loop2000("_loopNum_").IK5"
			      set cur2000IKind=individualST.GetSegmentIndex(cur2000pathIK,.cur2000status)
				  if '($ISOBJECT(ackObj))
				  {
					  set ackObj = ##class(IHC.X12.Data999).%New()
					  set ackObj.InterchangeReceiverID = interchangeReceiverID
					  set ackObj.InterchangeSenderID = interchangeSenderID
					  set ackObj.InterchangeReceiverName = ..GetTpName(interchangeReceiverID)
					  set ackObj.InterchangeSenderName = ..GetTpName(interchangeSenderID)

					  set ackObj.ApplicationReceiversCode = GS03
					  set ackObj.ApplicationSendersCode = GS02
					  set ackObj.GroupControlNumber = GS06
			  		  set ackObj.VersionReleaseIndustryIdenti =  GSver


					  set ackObj.GroupRespControlNumber = individualST.GetValueAt("AK1:2")
					  set ackObj.GroupRespIdentifierCode = individualST.GetValueAt("AK1:1")
					  set ackObj.GroupRespVersion = individualST.GetValueAt("AK1:3")
					  set ackObj.GroupRespFunctionalGroupAcknowledge = individualST.GetValueAt("AK9:1")
					  set ackObj.GroupRespNumberofTransactionSets = individualST.GetValueAt("AK9:2")
					  set ackObj.GroupRespAcceptedTransactions = individualST.GetValueAt("AK9:4")

					  set ackObj.UniqId = ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data999")

					  set ackObj.InterchangeControlNumber = x12Doc.GetValueAt("ISA:InterchangeControlNumber")
					  set ackObj.InterchangeDateTime= $ZSTRIP(x12Doc.GetValueAt("ISA:InterchangeDate"), "<>W") _ $ZSTRIP(x12Doc.GetValueAt("ISA:InterchangeTime"), "<>W")
					  set ackObj.ProcessDtTm = $ZDATETIME($HOROLOG,3, 1)
					  set ackObj.ReceiptDtTm = receiptDtTm
					  set ackObj.Status = "Processed"
					  set ackObj.SessionID = sessionId

					  set ackObj.FileName = ##class(%File).GetFilename(flNm)
			  		  set ackObj.MonthPartition = mmId


					  set fileSz = ##class(%File).GetFileSize(flNm)
					  if (fileSz  > 3641143) // Property x12Data As %String(MAXLEN = 3641144);
					  {

						  Set stream=##class(%FileCharacterStream).%New()
			    		  Set stream.Filename=flNm
			    		  set ackObj.x12DataStream = stream

					  }
					  else
					  {
					      set ackObj.x12Data = x12Doc.OutputToString(,.stat,)
					      if (stat '= 1)
					      {
						      $$$TRACE(  " --- The length of the document is greater than the maximum string length ---")
					      }
					  }  
					  set stat = ackObj.%Save()
					  Do $INCREMENT(objCnt)
					  set parentId = ackObj.%Id()

					  set ak2Obj = ackObj.%ConstructClone()
					  set ak2Obj.x12Data = ""
				   	  set ak2Obj.X12DataParentId = parentId
				   	  $$$TRACE("Saved 999, ID:" _ parentId)

				  }
				  FOR seg=cur2000ind:1:cur2000IKind
			   	  {
			   	  	set ak2Obj.x12Data =  ak2Obj.x12Data _ individualST.GetValueAt(seg) _ individualST.SegmentTerminator
			   	  }
			   	  set ak2Obj.TransactionsStatus =  individualST.GetValueAt(cur2000pathIK_":1")
			   	  set ak2Obj.TransRespIdentifierCode = individualST.GetValueAt(cur2000ind_":1")
				  set ak2Obj.TransRespControlNumber = individualST.GetValueAt(cur2000ind_":2")
				  set ak2Obj.TransRespVersion = individualST.GetValueAt(cur2000ind_":3")					  

			   	  set ak2Obj.X12DataParentId = parentId
			   	  set stat = ak2Obj.%Save()
			   	  $$$TRACE(  "GS-" _ GSnum _", ST: " _ STnum _ ", AK2: " _ loopNum  _  ", Id: " _ ak2Obj.%Id() _", stat: " _ stat)

			   	  Do $INCREMENT(objCnt)
			   	  set ak2Obj = ackObj.%ConstructClone()
			   	  set ak2Obj.x12Data = ""

				  Do $INCREMENT(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data999"))


			      Do $INCREMENT(loopNum)
			   }

	          }

             Do $INCREMENT(STnum)
          } 
          Do $INCREMENT(GSnum) 

     }
  }
  $$$TRACE(  " --- Processing complete: IHC.X12.Data999, ImplementationAcknowledgment, # rows:" _ objCnt)
  return ackObj.%Id()

	set ta1Obj = ##class(IHC.X12.DataTA1).%New()
	WRITE !, "	ProcessTA1 " _ transType	  

	if ($GET(^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType)) = "")
	 {

	 	set ^ItfGlobalX12IdKey("X12Data" _ transType) = 1
